  "body": "Urgent Price Adjustment. The owner is concerned about the marketing feedback and has agreed to an urgent price adjustment to generate more buyer interest. Call for details.\r\n\r\nStep into a world where comfort meets coastal elegance; your sun-drenched sanctuary awaits. This beautifully crafted, single-level family home invites you to embrace a lifestyle defined by effortless style, relaxed luxury, and the gentle rhythm of seaside living. Nestled on a sprawling half-acre (2,129 sqm) estate in one of the most desirable streets near Gulf Harbour, this solidly built four-bedroom retreat is your gateway to the coveted Whangaparaoa Peninsula lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA home designed for living, entertaining, and future land potential\r\n• Experience seamless indoor-outdoor flow with an open, thoughtfully designed layout. The heart of the home, a modern kitchen and light-filled dining area, connects effortlessly to the expansive BBQ patio and sparkling heated pool. Bask in all-day sunshine as you admire sweeping views across Gulf Harbour to the ocean beyond.\r\n• Surround yourself with generous, easy-care gardens that provide privacy, tranquillity, and abundant space for children, pets, and unforgettable gatherings with friends and family.\r\n• Ample parking caters to every passion—boats, cars, your touring camper, and all your coastal toys—so you can fully immerse yourself in the vibrant coastal lifestyle.\r\n• Developers & Land Bankers Take Note: Zoned for residential single-house, this property boasts exceptional development potential. The elevated views, premium location, and large land size, combined with proposed Unitary Plan changes, make this a unique and valuable investment opportunity.\r\n\r\nJust moments from your doorstep, discover some of New Zealand’s most beautiful beaches, world-class boating, and renowned golf courses. Spend your weekends exploring the pristine landscapes of Shakespear Regional Park, swimming in crystal-clear bays, or setting out on adventures across the Hauraki Gulf, where dolphins and orcas are still a regular sight.\r\n\r\nWhangaparaoa Peninsula – Where Every Day Feels Like a Holiday\r\n• Choose from 10 stunning beaches and bays, including Red Beach, Stanmore Bay, Big Manly, Tindalls Bay, and Army Bay—all just minutes away.\r\n• Enjoy top-rated schooling options for families, both public and private, with Wentworth College and Primary (offering the Cambridge International curriculum) just a 10-minute walk from home.\r\n• Become part of a thriving local community, with shopping, dining, cinemas, and a library all within easy reach.\r\n• Enjoy a breezy, scenic commute to Auckland CBD, North Shore, and Albany Basin.\r\n\r\nWith strong growth and vibrant development continuing across the peninsula, now is the perfect moment to secure your own slice of paradise. Whether you’re seeking a place for relaxation, adventure, or a welcoming community for your family, this exceptional property is ready to welcome you home.\r\n\r\nExperience the best of the Hibiscus Coast—where every detail is crafted for the lifestyle you deserve.",
